        "created_at": "2020-03-24T16:28:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Mint: Easy</p>\n<p>The best part of this mission was taping on thermal shockwave and seeing AZ had dealt 54 cold damge this turn before even using a power. &nbsp;</p>\n<p>I imagine using Thermal Shockwave and after AZ deals himself so much fire damage and it burns the entire Freedom tower to ash.</p>",
